<title>USA: Fingerhut issues $125 million 144A notes.</title>
<headline>Fingerhut issues $125 million 144A notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following rule 144A</p>
<p>private placement debt issue was priced on Tuesday, according</p>
<p>to a high-yield market source.</p>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co is lead manager on the deal.</p>
<p>BORROWER FINGERHUT COS</p>
<p>AMT $125 MLN	 COUPON 7.375 PCT  MATURITY 09/15/99</p>
<p>TYPE SENIOR NOTES  ISS PRICE 99.898  PAY DATE 03/27/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BAA3    SPREAD 102.5 BP   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-MINUS YIELD 7.412 PCT   CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-8599-1672</p>
